# Markdown: only README files are tracked (README.md, README_*.md, ... at any level).
# All other notes (CLAUDE.md, DEVELOPER.md, design decisions, research write-ups, claims,
# paper drafts, prompts) stay local and never reach the repo.
*.md
!*README*.md

# Superseded by download_example_data.sh
/get_example_data.sh

